WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.862
Lab 1.

2
00:00:00.862 --> 00:00:02.138
Eight tests pass.

3
00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:05.401
Then export October's
five fictional findings.

4
00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:08.175
Four closed, and one is
a declared exception.

5
00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:11.213
Two of three judged closures
were inside the window.

6
00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:14.095
Then the problems, by
name: one closed late,

7
00:00:14.095 --> 00:00:17.317
one whose evidence no
longer matches its hash,

8
00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:20.454
and one closed with no
re-read evidence at all;

9
00:00:20.454 --> 00:00:25.625
its close note just says done, which
the workbook calls prose, not evidence.

10
00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:30.088
The command exits with a failure rather
than producing a clean-looking package.

11
00:00:30.088 --> 00:00:32.040
The last line is the chain's head.
